WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:07.090
Let's see. This is squared, so X becomes...

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.390
Hello, what's up, Ritsu?

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.000
Good, you picked up. Where are you now, Mio?

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:15.650
Well, I'm at home.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.000
I'm at the station. Wanna go hang out?

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:24.030
Uh, I don't know. Summer classes begin tomorrow, so I need to study a little more, you know?

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:25.800
Just do it later tonight.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.490
But I'll be really tired tonight if I go out with you now.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:35.900
pass, okay? What? What's more important, me or studying? Whatever, I'll talk to you later.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:47.620
Seriously, does she ever study at all? Again? Yes, hello? What kind of panties are you wearing

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:59.970
right now? Stop! I tried my very best to get her to come out, I guess. What should I do now? Even you

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.440
I'm always studying with Nadoka today.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.730
Huh? Boogie?

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:11.760
Where's she going?

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.230
I think I'll surprise her.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:20.630
Huh?

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:29.960
Rick-chan, I saw you walking...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.600
by so i thought i'd surprise you did i do well yeah you stole my idea i'm surprised i never thought

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:41.160
i'd bump into you here yeah me too so then where were you headed to moogie summer classes begin

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:48.290
tomorrow right so i was planning on going shopping today i see oh well i was kind of hoping you were

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:55.440
free so we could go hang out or something no big deal though oh what's the matter just one moment

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:57.140
thank you. What's with the voice?

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:05.070
Hello? Yes, this is Tsumugi. Do you mind if we go shopping another time?

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.810
Yeah, that's great. Thank you.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.510
I'm free. Totally free.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:11.540
Okay.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:55.020
review what's happened so far. Mugi-chan's eyebrows are like pickled radishes. Tasty! Yummy! Mugi-chan,

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.300
can I have another piece?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.040
Caring is caring, so I'm having a piece, too.

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:06.170
Mmm!

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:07.320
It's so good!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.320
Mugi-chan?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.060
Well, when both of my eyebrows are taken off my face,

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.700
I quickly transform into a jelly-like substance.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:16.680
Jelly?

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.160
If they don't get replaced soon, then I am now.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:20.800
Mugi-chan!

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.360
Yui, get her more radishes!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.380
Well, where can I find radishes so quickly?

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.360
We'll just have to try everything we've got here.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:29.960
I'm fine now.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.160
Protractors work too, huh?

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.170
Triangular objects as well.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.060
Why is there a blanket on me?

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.390
It's easy to catch a cold while you're sleeping.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:44.530
I was crying to study. You should have woken me up.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.270
Well, I'm very sorry I didn't.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:51.160
So, where do you want to go?

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.960
I'll leave that to you, Rick-chan.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.060
You seem really excited.

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:59.090
Well, that's because it's our first time out, just the two of us, you and me.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:04:59.790
It's exciting!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.150
Now that you mention it, I guess it is.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:08.260
All right then, Moogie, I'll take you to some great places where you wouldn't usually go to.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.140
Like an arcade, for example.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.110
Oh, an arcade?

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.660
Oh, do you not want to go there?

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:18.130
No, no, no, no, I want to, I really, really want to go.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.900
Last time we went to the arcade with everyone, it was a lot of fun.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.130
Yeah, it was.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.540
All right then, it's decided, let's go.

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:35.030
You're fascinated by things pretty easily.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:39.170
Hey, what's that shining chandelier-looking thing here?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.350
It's a coin game.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:41.790
Oh.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.520
Then what's the steering wheel thing?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:45.680
A racing game.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:46.780
And this?

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.340
What's a fishing pole doing here?

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:49.620
It's a fishing game.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:51.460
Oh, what now, Rick-chan?

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.160
There's so much to do in an arcade.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.380
I don't know where to begin.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.620
What should we do?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.210
Just calm down.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:58.490
So, let's see.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:05:59.530
What should we play?

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:02.100
Let's try that.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.030
Aha!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.750
Let me give it a try.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.120
Rit-chan, I just avenged you.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.420
Thank you.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.380
Oh, I really want this stuffed doll.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.260
Okay, you just press this button over here.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.090
Alrighty, like this.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:28.490
That was close.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:29.710
Okay, let me try.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.580
You're amazing!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.110
Well, that's a given.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:43.740
I never thought I'd get it.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:47.680
All right, the picture's all done now.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.220
Let's start doodling.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.900
We can put this here and...

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.070
Oh, what's that?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.610
Maybe something else.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.740
You can do a lot with this.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:06:59.980
Let's go!

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.760
What if I press this?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:03.460
No!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.740
Big-chan, that's a good look for you.

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.660
Do I look like an old man to you?

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.240
Fine, take this, Mugi.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:10.760
Big!

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.570
Nadoka-chan, yours looks really good, too.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.110
Really?

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.820
Let's have a bite of each other's.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.320
No, it's okay, thanks.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.420
Yours is more expensive.

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:22.780
Don't worry about it.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.040
I just want to try yours.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:24.740
Really?

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:25.540
All right.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.620
Nodoka-chan, hey!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:43.440
Good, I'm glad you liked it. I'm happy I took you to the arcade.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.700
I think I might die from a happiness overdose soon.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:53.500
Let's not go overboard, but we did spend a lot of money at the arcade, so we really can't spend a lot at the next place.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.920
How about we go to the candy store?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.700
Candy store?

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:02.100
Rick-chan?

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:02.830
Huh?

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.320
Can I please give you a big hug?

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.760
What planet are you from?

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.440
Oh, so this is a candy store?

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.740
Yep, this is it.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.860
Everything in here is around 20 to 30 yen.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.240
We can shop our hearts out and not go broke.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.280
Really?

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:19.540
Even this?

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:20.520
Even that.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:21.540
Even these?

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:22.700
These things on a skewer?

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:23.240
Mm-hm.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.190
Even these fried things in a packet?

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:25.830
Yep.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.120
Even this really huge wafer?

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:28.760
Uh-huh.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:29.620
Wow!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.560
Is that what they mean by price is falling due to a recession?

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:33.920
I don't think so.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.080
There are a few tricks to eating snacks like this.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:38.820
Just watch me.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.310
You have to open a fugashi like this.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:43.290
Wow.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.940
Now watch how I drink this thing.

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.020
You start from this end.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:51.740
But why?

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.930
It'll last longer because you'll only be sipping a little bit at a time.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.500
I see. That's cool.

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.090
And this?

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:01.700
What should I do?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:02.480
Let me show you.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:07.040
You twirl it around like this, and then you put it in your mouth.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:07.820
See?

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.690
The strawberry on the cake?

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.090
She just took the whole thing.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:15.800
I don't get it.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:16.680
What's the big deal?

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:18.070
Isn't that weird?

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:19.550
You don't normally do that.

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:22.690
What do you mean you don't get it?

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:23.630
You see?

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:24.910
It's not that weird.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.650
It's the easiest thing to pick up.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.300
And I'd feel bad if I ate the cake.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:29.980
That's not it.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.320
The strawberry is the essence of the cake!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.200
It's the heart! It's the soul!

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:36.690
You're the only one who thinks that, Yui.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.510
Everyone on Earth thinks that, too!

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:39.690
Is that my sister?

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:43.030
Okay, fine then. You can have the chestnut

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.190
from the top of my cake. That way we're even.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:46.990
Oh, that's not it!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:48.990
Zunian's weird, right?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.050
No Doku-chan's wrong to take the strawberry.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:55.660
Oh, I had lots of fun today!

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:56.760
That's good.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.980
Rik-chan, you know so many fun places that I...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.180
I didn't even know existed. It's so cool.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:04.740
I like it. Raise me more.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:09.600
We got this for 500 yen and ate tons of stuff for only 100 yen.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:13.660
Rick-chan, no one can beat you in getting the best bang for our buck.

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:18.760
True, but from a normal person's point of view, we did spend a lot of money today.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.000
Really?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.020
Oh, yeah. And last month.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.970
I'm really sorry.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.060
Sorry, Mio, but do you think you can lend me some money?

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.020
Not again.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.780
How much do you need this time?

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.120
So that's a yes, right?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.880
Then I'll take these sticks here,

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.380
and these new scores,

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.260
and this new CD here, too.

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:42.800
Is that okay with you?

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.060
And then Mio kind of just went crazy.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:47.780
She just punched me out of the blue.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:49.070
Punch?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.400
What's the matter?

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:58.900
Actually, I have something important to ask you, Rick-chan.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:10:59.980
You know, I don't...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:08.240
have any money. I know. Oh no no no no! I didn't mean it that way! Oh there's something that I've

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:18.780
always kind of wanted to do, but... Wanted to do? Well... I'd like for you to... please!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:40.440
Sis! It's time to wake up now! Summer classes begin today, right? You should...

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:44.240
Oh, I'm sorry. You're up already.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:49.630
Yeah. It's been a while since I used the alarm, so I accidentally set it an hour ahead.

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:57.540
I accidentally wore my school uniform. What should I do?

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:58.950
Uniform!

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:04.370
Did we have to wear our school uniform for summer classes? I didn't know that!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:09.330
Oh, well, it would be normal to assume we have to wear a uniform for school, wouldn't it?

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.150
Oh no, really?

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:12.130
Morning!

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.710
Wow, Yui, you're actually early today.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:19.030
Rick-chan, what should we do? It seems like we should have worn our uniforms for summer classes.

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:22.220
Huh? Wait, that can't be right. Look.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:23.780
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.850
Actually, you know, it looks like you're the only one in school uniform here, Miu.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:29.980
Oh, God!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.660
Mio's the only one in uniform!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:36.240
Look at her! She's the only girl here wearing school uniform!

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:42.040
Bug off! There's no dress code specified, so it shouldn't matter, okay?

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:42.950
Morning!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:48.650
Getting dressed took Mio out today.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:50.110
Morning.

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.840
Mugi-chan looks like she's dressed for the beach today.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.940
Wait a sec, are we going to the beach afterwards?

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.340
No, we're not, Yui.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.870
Come on, we'd better go.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.030
Wait, Mugi.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.090
Yes?

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.870
Oh, the tag's still on your dress.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.620
And it would look better if you weren't wearing those socks with this dress, you know.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:19.580
Tell me she's...

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:22.310
I'd like you to please punch me.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:25.350
Well, you do know it'll hurt a lot, right?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.710
That doesn't matter to me.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.970
Well, if you're willing to bear with the...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:41.160
pain. Really? I'll do it lightly, okay? Yes, please do. No bodyguards are gonna jump out, right? No, I don't

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:51.700
think so. Okay, here I go. Okay, Chilly, just do a chop. Lightly. Okay, whatever you want.

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:55.650
Chop!

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:01.880
No, I just can't do it.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.560
Mugi, I just can't hit you without a reason.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.620
It really needs to be in the moment, okay?

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:07.880
In the moment?

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:08.580
Yeah.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.740
I'd feel really terrible if I hit you for no reason at all.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:15.880
Hitting you would only be justified if you did something seriously stupid.

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:17.450
Seriously stupid.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.520
So what, Nadoka-chan was weird, right?

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:23.870
If you could take a bite, you wouldn't go for the strawberry, would you?

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.290
Don't tell me, Mookies.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:26.840
Uh, maybe it's a prank.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.970
Last time Ritsu did that to me, I hit her really hard.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.320
heart on the head. I was so mad. So I understand how you feel, Yui.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:42.540
Nadoku-chan ate it like it was perfectly normal. Let's start by reading the study guides.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.980
Are there any books that can make you smarter and beat them?

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.420
Obviously not.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:50.340
So you're trying to make a fool out of yourself.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:55.080
Shouldn't I do that? I thought this dress would be the last thing someone would wear

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.420
to class, but I guess not.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.750
I thought it was weird. You usually dress appropriately.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:03.780
Well, you know what? You just need to be more obvious.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.830
Neo-chan, don't you feel hot?

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:08.770
No, I don't.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:09.930
Oh, yes, I see.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:11.250
No need to take notes.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.000
Come on, do you really want someone to hit you that badly?

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:18.300
Oh, I mean, you and Neo seem so close whenever she hits you.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.360
The same with you, it's Chan and Azusa-chan.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.740
I feel like I'm always left out of that.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:25.000
No one ever hits me.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.690
I really want to be part of it.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.100
Wow, you're actually pretty needy.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:33.980
All right, I'll help you since you're obviously not going to give up.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:34.700
Really?

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.010
Just don't be afraid of being embarrassed.

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:39.690
You have to give it everything you've got, Mugi!

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:40.690
Understand?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:41.690
Yes!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:45.910
Hey, you know, I didn't expect you and Ritsu to choose to go to college.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:50.900
Yeah, I know, but that's because Sawa-chan told us that it's too late to try to find a job now.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.900
Well, it's a bit late to start preparing for exams now, too, you know.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:56.960
Ah, a headband!

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:57.900
Okay.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:15:59.720
Hmm, Mio!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.550
I'll just take the exam next year! Stop messing around!

